  K0 Legendre: K|P| = A*a0/(A + a0);  claim a0 u/(1+u);  residual 0
  K0 Legendre: max_P[P.A - W] = a0*(A + log(a0**a0/(A + a0)**a0))/K;  claim (a0^2/K)(u - ln(1+u));  residual 0
  dJ/da0 at fixed |A| = (-A**2 + 2*(A + a0)*(A - log(((A + a0)/a0)**a0)))/(K*(A + a0));  claim (a0/K) S(u) with S = 2(u-ln(1+u)) - u^2/(1+u);  residual 0
  da0/dchi from a0 = kappa sqrt(G V) = sqrt(G)*kappa*Derivative(V(chi), chi)/(2*sqrt(V(chi)));  claim kappa^2 G V'/(2 a0);  residual 0
  Euler-Lagrange of L = -(1/2)(dchi)^2 - V + J: residual against (box chi - V' + dJ/dchi) = 0
  dJ/dchi - V' kappa^2 S(u)/(8 pi) with K = 4 pi G: residual 0
